  "description": "A database-backed policy store for DynamicWhere.ex field-level policies, built on Entity Framework Core with no raw SQL — so one package serves SQL Server, PostgreSQL, and any other EF Core provider. Implements IDwPolicyStore and IDwPolicyWritableStore, and passes the same store conformance suite the in-memory and Redis stores do. Also ships EfTokenVault, the durable store behind MaskStrategy.Tokenize, so a tokenized column still lines up after a restart. Ships the model rather than the migrations: apply the three entity configurations to your own DbContext and generate migrations for your own provider, or use the standalone DwPolicyDbContext. Version changes are polled from a single-row table, guarded by a concurrency token so two writers cannot lose an update. Requires DynamicWhere.ex. Full reference at https://doc.dynamicwhere.com.",
